eomics"},{"text":"Genomics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should support a research portfolio and laboratory experience, rather than becoming the primary qualification."},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Options"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term research careers, postgraduate education is highly valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"MSc"},{"type":"p","text":"Strong options include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Biochemistry"},{"text":"MSc Molecular Biology"},{"text":"MSc Biotechnology"},{"text":"MSc Life Sciences"},{"text":"MSc Molecular Medicine"},{"text":"MSc Bioinformatics"},{"text":"MSc Microbiology"},{"text":"MSc Cell Biology"},{"text":"MSc Medical Biochemistry"},{"text":"MSc Clinical Biochemistry"},{"text":"MSc Biotechnology & Bioprocessing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research-Oriented Specializations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Molecular Biology"},{"text":"Structural Biology"},{"text":"Protein Science"},{"text":"Enzymology"},{"text":"Cell Biology"},{"text":"Cancer Biology"},{"text":"Immunology"},{"text":"Genomics"},{"text":"Proteomics"},{"text":"Drug Discovery"},{"text":"Molecular Medicine"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD"},{"type":"p","text":"For a long-term academic or advanced R&D research career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biochemistry","M.Sc Biochemistry / Related Field","Research Assistant / Research Associate","Ph.D.","Postdoctoral Research","Research Scientist / Faculty / R&D Scientist"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"}]},{"heading":"Molecular Biology Research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","Molecular Biology Research Associate","Senior Research Associate","Research Scientist","Principal Scientist"]},{"type":"p","text":"Core skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PCR/qPCR"},{"text":"Gene expression"},{"text":"Cloning"},{"text":"Sequencing"},{"text":"Molecular assays"}]}]},{"heading":"Protein Science","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","Prote