oteomics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Metabolomics","Systems Biology"]},{"type":"h","text":"Single-Cell Biology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basic concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Single-cell sequencing"},{"text":"Single-cell transcriptomics"},{"text":"Cellular heterogeneity"},{"text":"Single-cell analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CRISPR & Gene Editing"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CRISPR-Cas systems"},{"text":"Gene knockout"},{"text":"Gene editing"},{"text":"Guide RNA"},{"text":"Genome engineering"},{"text":"Gene regulation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Laboratory Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Research laboratories are increasingly adopting:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated liquid handlers"},{"text":"Robotic sample preparation"},{"text":"High-throughput screening"},{"text":"Automated imaging"},{"text":"Digital laboratory notebooks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Research Assistant"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"Biochemistry Molecular Biology Research"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Protein Science PCR/qPCR Experimental Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Enzymology DNA/RNA Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Metabolism Gene Expression Literature Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Biomarkers Cloning Scientific Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└────────────────────┼────────────────────┘","Laboratory Skills"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Spectroscopy / Electrophoresis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Chromatography / Cell Culture","Data Analysis"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel / Prism / R / Python","Bioinformatics","Advanced Research"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong B.Sc Biochemistry graduate targeting Research Assistant roles should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand major biochemical pathways"},{"text":"Explain enzyme kinetics"},{"text":"Perform common biochemical assays"},{"text":"Prepare buffers and laboratory solutions"},{"text":"Use micropipettes accurately"},{"text":"Operate spectrophotometers"},{"text":"Perform protein quantification"},{"text":"Understand electrophoresis"},{"text":"Understand chromatography"},{"text":"Perform or assist with PCR"},{"text":"Understand molecular biology workflows"},{"text":"Understand cell culture fundamentals"},{"text":"Design basic controlled experiments"},{"text":"Distinguish biological and technical replicates"},{"text":"Perform basic statistical analysis"},{"text":"Use GraphPad Prism/Excel"},{"text":"Read and critically evaluate scientific papers"},{"text":"Write laboratory and research reports"},{"text":"Maintain detailed laboratory notebooks"},{"text":"Follow research ethics and data-integrity principles"},{"text":"Troubleshoot basic experimental problems"},{"text":"Present scientific results clearly"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong undergraduate portfolio should contain 4–6 research-oriented projects:"},{"type":"table","header":["Project","Skills Demonstrated"],"rows":[[{"text":"Enzyme Kinetics Study"},{"text":"Biochemistry + statistics"}],[{"text":"Protein Extraction & SDS-PAGE"},{"text":"Protein science"}],[{"text":"PCR-Based Molecular Study"},{"text":"Molecular biology"}],[{"text":"Cell Culture / Viability Study"},{"text":"Cell biology"}],[{"text":"Bioinformatics Analysis"},{"text":"Computational biology"}],[{"text":"Research Literature Review"},{"text":"Scientific reasoning + writing"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should follow a research structure:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Problem","Literature Review","Hypothesis","Experimental Design","Controls","Experiment","Raw Data","Statistical Analysis","Results","Discussion","Limitations","Conclusion"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"A biochemistry-trained research professional with strong foundations in molecular biology, protein science, enzymology, laboratory experimentation, statistical analysis and scientific communication, capable of supporting reproducible research and translating experimental data into scientifically defensible conclusions."},{"type":"h","text":"Best progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biochemistry","Research Intern","Research Assistant / Research Technician","Research Associate","Senior Research Associate / Scientist","Senior Scientist","Principal Scientist / Research Lead"]}]}]}